      "raw": "<p>Been playing for about 2 weeks now and LOVING this game.&nbsp; One question though, it says in the glossary that an Environment card cannot be dealt damage but that some environment cards have HP&#39;s.&nbsp; Does this mean you cannot target any environment card with HP&#39;s to reduce it to 0 and remove it from the game?&nbsp; This would mean that you would need a card that specifically removes an environment card in order to ever get rid of environment cards even if they have HP&#39;s.&nbsp; Sorry if this question is a bit confusing in its wording but I&#39;m not sure how else to explain it.</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>Thanks in advance for any clarifications.</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>Razman</p>",
