      "created_at": "2013-03-28T07:26:12.000Z",
      "cooked": "<p>Anything with HP is a possible target for attacks, so you can reduce it to zero.</p><p>Environment cards with HP are environment targets (which is a separate glossary entry but is also, sort of, mentioned in the glossary entry for environment cards in general. but yeah, it might take a moment to realize what it's saying depending on how you read it)</p>",
