      "created_at": "2013-03-28T13:57:01.000Z",
      "cooked": "<p>Yeah, an environment card with hp is also a target (<span class=\"bbcode-i\">any</span> card with hp is a target). Since it's in the einvronment <span class=\"bbcode-i\">deck</span>, it's also an environment <span class=\"bbcode-i\">card</span> and therefore can also be removed by anything that destroys environment cards (eg Grappling Hook, Bio-Engineering Beam, RPG Launcher, etc).</p>",
